      "type": "account",
      "description": "A customer account entity with defined state constraints including product association, balance calculation rules, dormancy thresholds, and status lifecycle management. The document specifies that accounts must be linked to a product, maintain balance integrity through transaction summation, transition to dormant status after 12 months of inactivity, and operate within a constrained set of valid statuses.",
      "context": [
